  "description": "A powerful and flexible .NET library for building dynamic LINQ expressions and database queries based on filter criteria. Provides type-safe, extensible solution for creating complex filtering logic for Entity Framework queries, in-memory collections, and any LINQ-compatible data source.",
  "id": "AvaProtein.BMS.Framework.DynamicFilterBuilder",
